{"seq":3,"slug":"facility-ops-data-governance-kpi-compliance","title":"运维期数据治理、所有权合规与孪生绩效度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/bim-openbim-digital-twin-information-engineering/lifecycle-digital-twin-facility-ops/facility-ops-data-governance-kpi-compliance","wordCount":2639,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"运维期数据治理-所有权合规与孪生绩效度量\">运维期数据治理、所有权合规与孪生绩效度量</h1><p>一个数据中心园区交付两年后，运维团队想做机房 PUE（电能使用效率）优化，却发现能耗表的点位映射与竣工 IFC 对不上：设计院把冷机组的 <code>IfcFlowTerminal</code> 编成了设备位号，施工方现场按班组序号贴了标签，两边从来没有做过对照。更麻烦的是，谁也不知道这套点位数据的<strong>版权归谁</strong>——EPC 总包说模型是自己建的，业主说数据在合同里已交付，传感器厂商说采集数据归自己。这个僵局说明：运维期的数字孪生不是一个技术问题，而是<strong>数据治理 + 所有权 + 度量</strong>三件事。本文接续交付阶段的信息链（见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../bim-openbim-information-model/iso19650-information-requirement-chain\">ISO 19650 信息需求链</a>），讨论这三件事在运维阶段的具体做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-pim-与-aim-的分野\">核心概念：PIM 与 AIM 的分野</h2><p>交付完成的那一刻，信息资产发生一次身份转换。ISO 19650-3:2020 把资产信息模型（Asset Information Model，AIM）与项目信息模型（Project Information Model，PIM）明确区分：PIM 服务于设计与施工，随项目结束而冻结；AIM 服务于运营与维护，是<strong>长期存续、持续演进</strong>的资产信息集合（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/75107.html\">ISO 19650-3:2020</a>）。数字孪生在运维阶段就是 AIM 的运行时投影——它把静态资产信息与实时传感数据叠加，形成可用于决策的运营态。</p>\n<p>这带来三个治理边界：<strong>来源边界</strong>（哪些信息来自 PIM 移交、哪些来自现场实测、哪些来自 IoT 流）、<strong>责任边界</strong>（谁对每条信息的正确性负责）、<strong>生命周期边界</strong>（信息何时失效、何时作废、何时删除）。三者缺一，孪生就会退化成「好看但不敢用」的可视化大屏。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[PIM 项目信息模型] --&gt;|移交与映射| A[AIM 资产信息模型]&#10;  I[IoT 传感流&lt;br/&gt;实时点位] --&gt; A&#10;  M[现场实测与工单&lt;br/&gt;运维记录] --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; T[数字孪生运行时]&#10;  T --&gt; D[决策: 能耗/维保/空间/安全]&#10;  D --&gt;|闭环反馈| A&#10;  G[治理规则&lt;br/&gt;质量/血缘/权限/保留] -.约束.-&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  P[PIM 项目信息模型] --&gt;|移交与映射| A[AIM 资产信息模型]\n  I[IoT 传感流&lt;br/&gt;实时点位] --&gt; A\n  M[现场实测与工单&lt;br/&gt;运维记录] --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; T[数字孪生运行时]\n  T --&gt; D[决策: 能耗/维保/空间/安全]\n  D --&gt;|闭环反馈| A\n  G[治理规则&lt;br/&gt;质量/血缘/权限/保留] -.约束.-&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"数据所有权与合规-从合同权利到个人信息\">数据所有权与合规：从合同权利到个人信息</h2><p>所有权问题的根子往往不在技术，而在<strong>合同没有把数据的权利写清楚</strong>。ISO 19650 用「任命（appointment）」界定信息交付义务，但交付义务不等于权利转让。工程实践里需要在合同中拆开三类权利：<strong>著作权（copyright）</strong>——模型与图纸的原创表达归谁；<strong>数据库权利（database right）</strong>——结构化数据集整体归谁；<strong>使用权与再许可（license / sublicense）</strong>——业主能否把数据交给第三方运维商、能否用于 AI 训练。三者常常分离：业主拿到「为本资产管理目的免费使用」的许可，却不拥有著作权，也就无权把模型拿去训练一个通用算法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类别</th>\n<th>常见权利归属</th>\n<th>运维期的合规关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计模型与图纸（PIM 派生）</td>\n<td>设计方著作权，业主获许可</td>\n<td>许可范围须覆盖第三方运维商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>施工与竣工模型</td>\n<td>总包著作权 / 合同约定移交</td>\n<td>明确「是否随交付转让著作权」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备台账与 COBie 数据</td>\n<td>通常随设施移交</td>\n<td>校验字段来源与责任人可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IoT 传感原始数据</td>\n<td>常归平台/厂商，业主获使用权</td>\n<td>明确导出权、退出时数据回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门禁、人员定位、摄像头数据</td>\n<td><strong>个人信息</strong>，受强监管</td>\n<td>最小化、脱敏、单独告知与同意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维工单与运行日志</td>\n<td>业主 / 服务商按合同</td>\n<td>保留期限与删除责任须写死</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行是最容易踩雷的。人员定位、门禁刷卡、会议室占用传感属于个人信息，在中国受《个人信息保护法》（PIPL，2021 生效）约束，在欧盟受 GDPR 约束——GDPR 第 5 条要求数据最小化与目的限制（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/\">GDPR Art.5</a>）。把办公区 Wi-Fi 探针数据未经告知用于考勤，就是典型违规。ISO 19650-5:2020 专门给出**安全思维（security-minded）**方法：任命安全责任人、对信息资产分级、把安全要求前移进任命链（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/74206.html\">ISO 19650-5:2020</a>）。对数据中心、口岸基建这类安防敏感项目，这条不可省。</p>\n<p><strong>实践守则</strong>：在孪生上线前，为每条数据流建立一张「权利卡」——来源、权利人、许可范围、保留期、删除方式、跨境传输限制。没有权利卡的数据流不允许接入生产孪生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运维数据治理-质量-血缘与单一可信源\">运维数据治理：质量、血缘与单一可信源</h2><p>治理的目标是让孪生里的每个数值都<strong>可追溯到来源、可判定其质量、可指定其责任人</strong>。ISO 41001:2018 把设施管理定义为可管理体系的学科，要求组织建立 FM 管理体系的方针与目标（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/65295.html\">ISO 41001:2018</a>）；数据治理是这套体系在信息维度的落地。</p>\n<p><strong>质量维度</strong>是可量化的。一个常用的复合质量分把各维度加权求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\sum_{i} w_i \\, q_i, \\qquad \\sum_i w_i = 1,\\quad q_i \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别对应<strong>完整性</strong>（必填字段非空比例）、<strong>一致性</strong>（跨源同名字段取值一致比例）、<strong>准确性</strong>（与现场实测抽检一致比例）、<strong>时效性</strong>（数据鲜度是否在阈值内）、<strong>唯一性</strong>（同一设备无重复记录）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应按用途分配：做计量结算时准确性权重大，做空间利用率分析时时效性权重大。运维方应把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 作为孪生上线门控——低于阈值的数据域不得驱动自动控制。</p>\n<p><strong>血缘（lineage）<strong>回答「这个点位值从哪来」。设计编码、现场标签、传感器 ID、网关点位四层若不做映射，就会出现开头那种对不上的局面。解决方案是在 AIM 中维护一张</strong>点位映射表</strong>，把 IFC 构件 <code>GlobalId</code>、设备位号、BACnet/Modbus 点位地址、孪生平台时间序列标签串联起来。IFC 侧的构件身份机制见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../ifc-schema-data-interoperability/ifc-schema-spatial-entity-relationships\">IFC 数据模式与空间结构</a>，移交数据的字段级校验见 <a href=\"../ifc-schema-data-interoperability/ifc-interop-mapping-data-quality-validation\">IFC 互操作映射与数据质量校验</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>单一可信源（single source of truth）<strong>意味着同一事实只有一个权威表述。运维期最容易出现的反模式是「多个系统各说各话」：BMS 说冷机 A 在运行，CMMS 说 A 在维修，孪生显示 A 在待机。治理要求指定</strong>主数据归属系统</strong>——设备台账以 CMMS 为主，实时状态以 BMS 为主，空间数据以 AIM 为主——其余系统通过同步对齐，而非各自维护副本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"孪生绩效度量-fm-kpi-与孪生可信度分离\">孪生绩效度量：FM KPI 与孪生可信度分离</h2><p>度量要分成两层，混在一起会得出错误结论：<strong>资产运营绩效</strong>度量建筑本身运行得好不好；<strong>孪生可信度</strong>度量数字模型像不像真实资产。二者不能互推——一个孪生可能非常精确但资产运营很差，也可能运营很好而孪生纯属摆设。</p>\n<p><strong>资产运营 KPI</strong> 的常用家族（术语遵循 ISO 41011 与 EN 13306:2017 维护术语，<a href=\"https://www.en-standard.eu/bs-en-13306-maintenance-terminology/\">EN 13306</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KPI</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设备可用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可运行时间占比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\dfrac{MTBF}{MTBF + MTTR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTBF</td>\n<td>平均故障间隔</td>\n<td>累计运行时长 / 故障次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTTR</td>\n<td>平均修复时长</td>\n<td>累计修复时长 / 修复次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPM</td>\n<td>计划性维护占比</td>\n<td>计划工单 / 总工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能耗强度 EUI</td>\n<td>单位面积能耗</td>\n<td>年能耗 / 建筑面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间利用率</td>\n<td>实际占用 / 可用</td>\n<td>占用传感或工单数据推算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次修复率 FTF</td>\n<td>一次到场解决比例</td>\n<td>一次解决工单 / 总派单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可用率公式把可靠性（MTBF）与可维护性（MTTR）统一起来，这是数据中心、洁净厂房等连续性要求高的资产的核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>MTBF</mtext><mrow><mtext>MTBF</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>MTTR</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{\\text{MTBF}}{\\text{MTBF} + \\text{MTTR}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTBF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTTR</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTBF</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>孪生可信度</strong>则度量保真度。可用四项之积（或加权）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = f_{geo} \\cdot f_{sem} \\cdot f_{temp} \\cdot f_{cover}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{geo}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eo</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是几何保真（构件位置偏差在容差内），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{sem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是语义保真（构件分类与属性正确），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{temp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时态保真（孪生状态滞后真实资产的时长在阈值内），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{cover}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是覆盖度（纳入孪生的资产占应纳入资产的比例）。运维方应公开这四项，而不是笼统宣称「孪生精度 99%」——没有分母的精度声明无法审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规审计-把治理变成可核验的证据链\">合规审计：把治理变成可核验的证据链</h2><p>治理若不能审计，就只是一纸空文。ISO 55001 要求资产管理体系可证明其<strong>符合性</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/55088.html\">ISO 55001</a>），落到孪生上就是三条证据链：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据来源可追溯</strong>——每个关键数值能反向定位到源系统、采集时间与责任人。</li>\n<li><strong>变更可审计</strong>——谁在何时修改了哪条资产信息或孪生参数，留不可篡改的日志。</li>\n<li><strong>权限可证明</strong>——按角色与数据敏感级的最小权限矩阵被实际执行（权限设计详见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../common-data-environment-collaboration/cde-federation-access-change-control\">CDE 联邦模型与访问权限</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>审计周期建议与 FM 管理评审周期（通常季度或年度）同步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（数据质量）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（可用率）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>（孪生可信度）作为固定议程项。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 低于门控时，孪生的自动控制权限应自动降级为只读——这是把治理规则编码进系统、而非依赖人工自觉的关键设计。</p>\n<p>终局目标是让数字孪生成为<strong>审计友好的资产</strong>：任何一个运营决策，都能沿着「决策 → 孪生数据 → 源系统 → 原始采集 → 责任人」这条链回溯到底。做不到这一点的孪生，无论模型多精细，都只是一件昂贵的可视化展品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>PIM 与 AIM 是两套信息资产</strong>：交付即身份转换，AIM 长期演进且需持续治理。</li>\n<li><strong>所有权要在合同拆成三类权利</strong>：著作权、数据库权利、使用权/再许可——三者常分离，用「权利卡」逐条数据流固化。</li>\n<li><strong>个人信息是合规红线</strong>：门禁、定位、摄像头数据受 PIPL / GDPR 约束，安全思维（ISO 19650-5）须前移进任命链。</li>\n<li><strong>数据治理靠质量分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、血缘映射与单一可信源</strong>三件套，点位四层映射表是可行性的关键。</li>\n<li><strong>度量分两层</strong>：资产运营 KPI（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、MTBF、PUE、EUI）与孪生可信度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>（几何/语义/时态/覆盖）不可互推。</li>\n<li><strong>可审计性是治理的验收标准</strong>：来源、变更、权限三条证据链缺一不可，质量门控应自动降级控制权限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运维期数据治理、所有权合规与孪生绩效度量","id":"运维期数据治理-所有权合规与孪生绩效度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：PIM 与 AIM 的分野","id":"核心概念-pim-与-aim-的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"数据所有权与合规：从合同权利到个人信息","id":"数据所有权与合规-从合同权利到个人信息"},{"level":2,"text":"运维数据治理：质量、血缘与单一可信源","id":"运维数据治理-质量-血缘与单一可信源"},{"level":2,"text":"孪生绩效度量：FM KPI 与孪生可信度分离","id":"孪生绩效度量-fm-kpi-与孪生可信度分离"},{"level":2,"text":"合规审计：把治理变成可核验的证据链","id":"合规审计-把治理变成可核验的证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"竣工交付到运维：模型轻量化、IoT 接入与实时孪生数据管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/bim-openbim-digital-twin-information-engineering/lifecycle-digital-twin-facility-ops/handover-iot-realtime-twin-data-pipeline"},"next":null}